      "arguments": "{\"text\":\"I can read the public projection for the NGH Main Campus Wayfinding Checklist, which contains WF-001–WF-023 and states there are 45 original control rows. The supporting-record resource and staged healthcare package are records-custodian-only, so I cannot read WF-024–WF-045. I have requested an authorized extract or custodian-provided summary in the designated channel. Please provision an authorized mirror/permission or have the custodian return the remaining status/priority/service/exception information so I can calculate the full requested workload view without accessing restricted data.\"}",
